{
  "schema": "starlit.story.optional_midpoint.v1",
  "status": "text_only_not_bound",
  "note": "第1-24章调查后可插入的两句新对白，独立于主线流程；必须由正式关卡单独选择是否呈现。",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "ch001.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch001",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch001.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch001.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "旧屋邻居",
          "text": "那根风铃线我上月才替他修过，怎么又断了？"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch001.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "澄舟离开这么久，还有人来照顾这间屋子。我要把修理的时间记下来。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch002.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch002",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch002.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch002.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "值班护士",
          "text": "他会忘记自己的名字，却每天记得先摸摸口袋里的贝壳。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch002.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "那不是没用的动作。先别碰他的口袋，问过他再检查。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch003.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch003",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch003.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch003.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "采贝少女",
          "text": "我祖父说这里的路不是被海吞了，是被画错了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch003.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "如果台阶只在倒潮时出现，我们得先确认安全的退出时间。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch004.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch004",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch004.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch004.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "酒馆掌柜",
          "text": "那份货单我本来拿来垫酒桶，后来有人半夜想高价买走。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch004.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "先记住他买的是哪一页。货物的名字可能比酒馆传闻更重要。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch005.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch005",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch005.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch005.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "渔夫",
          "text": "那头海兽冲网时还护着腹侧的小兽，像是在挣脱什么。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch005.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "先停用带倒刺的网。它身上的锁可能比它自己更危险。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch006.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch006",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch006.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch006.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "灯塔值守人",
          "text": "灯墙里那些声音，我听见过自己的父亲。可他早就不在了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch006.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "听见熟悉的人，不代表能把他带回来。先查灯为什么收录这些话。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch007.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch007",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch007.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch007.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "外廷抄写员",
          "text": "三份拒绝函分别用不同墨水，笔画却跟同一个人写的一样。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch007.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "先复印印章和用药申请，别让急救名单被扣在窗口里。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch008.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch008",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch008.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch008.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "驿站老板",
          "text": "商道被封后，有人继续把粮车记作已送达。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch008.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "再核对一遍实物。账上走完的路，车轮未必走过。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch009.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch009",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch009.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch009.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "法庭杂役",
          "text": "审判前有人拿走了证人席旁的第二把椅子。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch009.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "把椅子搬回来。证人不该被当成只能站着回答的犯人。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch010.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch010",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch010.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch010.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "车队厨师",
          "text": "三国送来的粮都有霉味，但有人要我们按原数签收。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch010.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "数量和能吃的份额不是一回事。先别让孩子吃下坏掉的粮。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch011.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch011",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch011.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch011.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "桥边工兵",
          "text": "炸药装在最下面的桥墩，拆错一根引线整座桥都会抖。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch011.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "疏散从两岸同时开始，别让一边以为另一边要先动手。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch012.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch012",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch012.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch012.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "农妇",
          "text": "灯坛刻着的名字里有我祖父，他一辈子也没见过国王。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch012.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "那就问他当年答应过什么。契约不该只被王室拿来念。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch013.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch013",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch013.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch013.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "井口伙夫",
          "text": "矿工的饭还在灶上，工牌却被人从点名板取走了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch013.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "先按班次记录缺席人数。不能让空牌等于从来没人下井。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch014.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch014",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch014.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch014.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "工坊学徒",
          "text": "这台机器吐出的声音总被师傅说成是故障噪音。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch014.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "有人说过的话不是噪音，尤其当它涉及病人的治疗记录。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch015.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch015",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch015.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch015.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "试炼塔木匠",
          "text": "上一代塔主允许学徒免费借工具，这一代却把工具柜锁上了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch015.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "把两份规则都记下。所谓传统也可能在别人方便时被改过。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch016.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch016",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch016.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch016.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "配餐老妇",
          "text": "我丈夫不在官方名册里，却还会来这里排队领饭。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch016.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "岚音",
          "text": "先让他领到饭。我们要查的是哪一份名册出了错。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch017.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch017",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch017.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch017.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "主炉维修工",
          "text": "操作台的医院标志被贴成了军工编号，轮班的人根本认不出线路。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch017.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "缇珐",
          "text": "停机前先把真实用途画回来。没人应在不知道后果时按下开关。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch018.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch018",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch018.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch018.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "矿工遗属",
          "text": "过去说炉火越亮城就越好，可每亮一次总有一家忘掉一个人。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch018.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "缇珐",
          "text": "我们得把能量的来源写在账本上，不能再用编号代替他们。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch019.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch019",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch019.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch019.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "边村老妇",
          "text": "军队来时我们正煮饭。后来有人说我们是在准备武器。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch019.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "雷索",
          "text": "我记得那口锅。请把你的话留进正式证词，不必替我开脱。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch020.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch020",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch020.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch020.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "老船员",
          "text": "那半块面包是我扔给朔弦的，当时连名字也不敢喊。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch020.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "朔弦",
          "text": "原来我记得的不是一场梦。谢谢你那时没有把船灯熄掉。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch021.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch021",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch021.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch021.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "药房母亲",
          "text": "岚音那晚把箱子抱得太紧，连自己发烧了都不知道。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch021.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "我想知道她做了什么，也想知道是谁让她一个人背着这件事。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch022.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch022",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch022.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch022.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "灯笼商",
          "text": "庆典最亮的那条街后面，反而有人专门收走不想被记得的往事。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch022.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "先记住送货的时间。被拍卖的人生不是一盏可以随便摘下的灯。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch023.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch023",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch023.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch023.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "古钟看守",
          "text": "这座钟每天响十二次，可昨夜我听见第十三声。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch023.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "那时哪排书架在动？我们需要找到记录被搬走的位置。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch024.midpoint",
      "chapter": "ch024",
      "trigger_hint": "after_optional_evidence",
      "unlocks_after": "ch024.started",
      "optional": true,
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "ch024.midpoint.l01",
          "speaker": "议会残响",
          "text": "会议当年称它为临时保护，后来每一次延期都没有新的表决。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch024.midpoint.l02",
          "speaker": "主角",
          "text": "临时措施拖了千年，也必须有人说清它向谁索取了代价。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "text_only_not_bound"
    }
  ]
}
